# 供应链业务知识网络

本业务知识网络完整覆盖从订单到发货的全供应链业务流程数据，包含6个实体对象（客户、供应商、工厂、仓库、产品、物料）和8个事件对象（销售订单、采购订单、生产订单、物料采购、发货、库存、BOM、物料领料）。

## Network Overview

- **ObjectTypes** (object_types/): customer, factory, supplier, material, product, warehouse, bom, sales_order, inventory, shipment, material_procurement, purchase_order, production_order, material_requisition
- **RelationTypes** (relation_types/): customer_places_sales_order, sales_order_contains_product, product_links_bom, material_in_bom, material_in_inventory, product_in_inventory, inventory_in_warehouse, warehouse_to_material_requisition, material_requisition_to_factory, factory_to_production_order, production_order_for_product, warehouse_provides_shipment, shipment_to_customer, purchase_order_contains_material, purchase_order_from_supplier, supplier_delivers_material_shipment, material_shipment_to_warehouse
- **ConceptGroups** (concept_groups/): entity_objects, event_objects, derived_objects
